## ADDED — flows：天气数据源（1 个 flow）

> 追加到 `flows` 数组末尾。case_id 复用 test-cases.md 的 ST-S03-24。天气 mock 控制面见外部依赖说明（geocoding/forecast 固定 JSON；`weather_unavailable` 覆盖降级）。

```json
[
  {
    "case_id": "ST-S03-24",
    "type": "normal",
    "description": "声明城市后建议理由可引用天气（weather-data-source）",
    "covers_steps": "架构 5.8 + core-05 增补",
    "steps": [
      {
        "step": "前置：声明所在城市偏好",
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/me/preferences",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
        },
        "body": {
          "pref_key": "location",
          "value": "杭州"
        },
        "expected_status": 200
      },
      {
        "step": "前置：天气 mock 就绪（fixed JSON）",
        "mock": {
          "dependency": "天气",
          "strategy": "mock-service",
          "config": "geocoding + forecast 固定 JSON；weather_unavailable 覆盖降级"
        }
      },
      {
        "step": "前置：LLM mock 置 propose_timing（理由引用天气）",
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "{{mock_base}}/_control",
        "body": {
          "mode": "propose_timing"
        },
        "expected_status": 204
      },
      {
        "step": "生成建议",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes/{{wish_id}}/timing-proposals",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
        },
        "expected_status": 200,
        "assert": [
          "body.degraded == false",
          "body.proposal.status == 'pending'",
          "every(e in body.proposal.evidence : e.kind != 'weather')"
        ]
      },
      {
        "step": "确认后链路不变",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes/{{wish_id}}/timing-proposals/{{proposal_id}}/confirm",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
        },
        "body": {},
        "expected_status": 200,
        "assert": [
          "body.wish.state == 'brewing'"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
]
```
